.json","size_bytes":183}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-qy.1","local_name":"sase-qy.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-qy","agent_clan_generation":"20260819100346","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-qy.1","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-qy[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Always-on query bar across every Artifacts sub-tab[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Every Artifacts sub-tab that can be queried shows its query bar at [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]all times, in one shared visual grammar, so pressing the query key [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]never shifts the layout and the active query is always readable [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]from the pane it filters.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]artifacts_persistent_query_bar.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/artifacts_persistent_query_bar.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-qy[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-qy/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared persistent query-bar chrome[/bold #D7AFFF]                            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]chrome[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]chrome: give FilterBar a real idle presentation -- a profile-driven, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]syntax-highlighted closed display with an empty-query placeholder, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]accent-driven border/sigil/completion colors, and click-to-edit -- and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]adopt it on the two bars that are already persistent.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Persistent query bar on Bead and File[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]panes[dim] · [dim][/dim]after chrome[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]panes: make BeadFilterBar and FileFilterBar persistent, add a single [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`_sync_query_bar` funnel that keeps each idle bar's text and status [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]truthful, and stop echoing the active query as chips in those panes' [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]identity headers.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Persistent query bar on Plan and every document provider[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]documents[dim] · [dim][/dim]after panes[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]documents: make PlanFilterBar persistent for the Plan pane and every [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`ref:<kind>` provider pane, surface deep-archive coverage in the idle [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]status lane, and delete the now-unused filter-token echo from the shared[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]scope renderer.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Always-on invariant, conformance, and visual grammar docs[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]grammar[dim] · [dim][/dim]after documents[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]grammar: add the cross-pane regression that every non-degraded resolved [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sub-tab mounts a visible, read-only query bar in its own accent, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rewrite the visual grammar doc's filter slot, state table, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Patch-asymmetry sections.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-qy","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-qy.1","reasoning_effo